      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QQ: where's a better\nplace to store the\nhydration logic? \n\nkeeping within\nsimulation makes it\nneed a bunch of other\nmodules for no reason",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "4uQVV1POE1Ryu1xLoFwK6",
      "originalText": "QQ: where's a better place to store the hydration logic? \n\nkeeping within simulation makes it need a bunch of other modules for no reason",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0SjBi4BpQY6AIxx3XnR5f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3310.815199143649,
      "y": -1053.7670381678108,
      "width": 276.18825682055535,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b1azzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 962260160,
      "version": 654,
      "versionNonce": 1478039360,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[purpose]\n1. Defines command groups for CLI\ncommand\n\n2. Injects args to simulation and\nruns the simulation",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[purpose]\n1. Defines command groups for CLI command\n\n2. Injects args to simulation and runs the simulation",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sgY_-26zPNoYyHfBLji3s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3596.3918058738045,
      "y": -552.9100039335137,
      "width": 414.7833251953125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b1azzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 172439360,
      "version": 976,
      "versionNonce": 588709056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[purpose]\n1. owns a simulator instance, controls the running of \n   a simulator instance\n2. runtime fixtures setup: \n     - uses the loader to load specs from input files\n     - hydrates static specs into runtime instances:\n        a) simulation events\n        b) nodes\n3. controls the simulator instance",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[purpose]\n1. owns a simulator instance, controls the running of \n   a simulator instance\n2. runtime fixtures setup: \n     - uses the loader to load specs from input files\n     - hydrates static specs into runtime instances:\n        a) simulation events\n        b) nodes\n3. controls the simulator instance",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mkRuaVxMA3ir1r_OjfQeM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4209.438600465167,
      "y": -507.4632130248374,
      "width": 571.0333251953125,
      "height": 440,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b1azzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 266590016,
      "version": 1482,
      "versionNonce": 299269804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763384158556,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[purpose] \n\n1. main mutable state representation for the simulation runtime\n\n   a) utility states: \n      - counters for msg ids, event ids\n      - time and clock\n\n   b) nodes (simulation participants)\n\n   c) scheduler for driving simulation events\n       \n\n2. defines the simulation time loop\n    - defines a tick\n    - controls dispatching of events scheduled by the scheduler\n\n3. owns a registry of: \n   a) partition registry: just a map of partition id to partition\n   b) node registry: a map of node to the partition that it is currently in\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[purpose] \n\n1. main mutable state representation for the simulation runtime\n\n   a) utility states: \n      - counters for msg ids, event ids\n      - time and clock\n\n   b) nodes (simulation participants)\n\n   c) scheduler for driving simulation events\n       \n\n2. defines the simulation time loop\n    - defines a tick\n    - controls dispatching of events scheduled by the scheduler\n\n3. owns a registry of: \n   a) partition registry: just a map of partition id to partition\n   b) node registry: a map of node to the partition that it is currently in\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ysP27IK7ggu3i-LPQ-3-G",
