    },
    {
      "id": "_rmhUyKLqg3ZMW1NJrm8Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5574.116827357662,
      "y": -1040.2065758819658,
      "width": 384.95423434957695,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b23",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1425889088,
      "version": 1406,
      "versionNonce": 615013568,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "W9dfah5X0gIbbumLl_LjV",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. handles logical representation of time within a\nclock\n\n2. can be instantiated as many times to allow\ndifferent entities to have their own local clock",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. handles logical representation of time within a clock\n\n2. can be instantiated as many times to allow different entities to have their own local clock",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XIMU88ryYdJ3H8zK0hFz5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5576.464319127865,
      "y": -1220.0011521943131,
      "width": 384.95423434957695,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b26",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 41557824,
      "version": 1601,
      "versionNonce": 505990976,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. simple mutable counter, spits out next values",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. simple mutable counter, spits out next values",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gZByBu0icz5ZujWxTTVUk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5584.465065756596,
      "y": -373.3168321894193,
      "width": 449.8893200455009,
      "height": 189.62646992904754,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b29",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 903143232,
      "version": 2184,
      "versionNonce": 1358873792,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. communication primitive\n   - meta submodule will keep messaging metadata: time\nstamp, msg id, topic of communication\n\n2. has clear variants: Coordination, Control, Time  to\ncreate messages with specific data within them\n\n3. carries polymorphic payloads. Type is parameterised,\nallowing any type of payload to work with messages. ",
      "fontSize": 16.855686215915338,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. communication primitive\n   - meta submodule will keep messaging metadata: time stamp, msg id, topic of communication\n\n2. has clear variants: Coordination, Control, Time  to create messages with specific data within them\n\n3. carries polymorphic payloads. Type is parameterised, allowing any type of payload to work with messages. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "41Y24QiCk85JJBrTt2yqc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4862.93095438851,
      "y": -503.30688553477535,
      "width": 431.4222757596183,
      "height": 147.48725438925922,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b2A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1542817600,
      "version": 2705,
      "versionNonce": 1456269120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[purpose]\n1. Acts as an events buffer primarily since it stores\nsimulation events that get submitted to it\n\n2. Allows simulator to retrieve the due events at a\nparticular point in time, which is the bare minimum\n\"scheduling\" that it does. ",
      "fontSize": 16.855686215915338,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[purpose]\n1. Acts as an events buffer primarily since it stores simulation events that get submitted to it\n\n2. Allows simulator to retrieve the due events at a particular point in time, which is the bare minimum \"scheduling\" that it does. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hlHMc9zuerHTIAOqY6S3j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4862.860034109603,
      "y": -139.96392901967693,
      "width": 431.4222757596183,
      "height": 168.55686215915338,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
