      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "problem: at the moment, the logger can only\nconsume strings / primitives. This is because\nthe current implementation makes it such that\nthe logger is NOT a singleton, it's specific to\nevery module. \n\nThis easily gives us circular dependency issues. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lAWBN4UVgssdjNA8Rc0Zc",
      "originalText": "problem: at the moment, the logger can only consume strings / primitives. This is because the current implementation makes it such that the logger is NOT a singleton, it's specific to every module. \n\nThis easily gives us circular dependency issues. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
