    {
      "id": "eOIIwS1jFndLiO8WWwNyJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6808.3994539969935,
      "y": -57.7696006832864,
      "width": 356.8999938964844,
      "height": 240,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b2h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 959539008,
      "version": 4147,
      "versionNonce": 2046221504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763107967593,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[PROBLEM]\n storage seems to be something specific to\nnodes and is not something that needs global\norchestration. \n\nTherefore, Make_node functor shouldn't\nexpect storage. Storage should automatically\nbe created within the node.\n\nLikely principle: \"any entity that wishes to\nstore things should create their own\nstorage\" ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2HJGpvxy_NR5z1LVmRF_9",
      "originalText": "[PROBLEM]\n storage seems to be something specific to nodes and is not something that needs global orchestration. \n\nTherefore, Make_node functor shouldn't expect storage. Storage should automatically be created within the node.\n\nLikely principle: \"any entity that wishes to store things should create their own storage\" ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
