      "text": "Interface: Node_state",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "R-ktECIRzgSi0vJc-eESh",
      "originalText": "Interface: Node_state",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9-2aMieoR4kaD14dAAhFZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6250.869490068855,
      "y": 547.9411773781853,
      "width": 391.24399966417445,
      "height": 231.7656854688359,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b2k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1285222208,
      "version": 5435,
      "versionNonce": 1647322944,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763108285856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A node plays 3 independent roles at the\nsame time: Proposer, Acceptor, Learner and\neach of these will keep their own state. These\nstates and their transitions (including triggers,\ntransition conditions) are the responsibility of\nNode_state\n\n2. Node_state effectively is the concrete\nimplementation of the paxos protocol in the\nform of event handlers. Handlers:\n   a) ",
      "fontSize": 16.855686215915338,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. A node plays 3 independent roles at the same time: Proposer, Acceptor, Learner and each of these will keep their own state. These states and their transitions (including triggers, transition conditions) are the responsibility of Node_state\n\n2. Node_state effectively is the concrete implementation of the paxos protocol in the form of event handlers. Handlers:\n   a) ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KXVgLYP11T4Vbx1Zyk3IM",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 6805.142895973374,
      "y": 535.3172996368744,
      "width": 341.32450048369395,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
