      "text": "Interface: Node",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "IZfbhGWZiaCaoSp_flxL-",
      "originalText": "Interface: Node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XI5FReiwXjTntgpvEIgl2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6279.767561491924,
      "y": 1086.6569146997872,
      "width": 391.24399966417445,
      "height": 316.0441165484126,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "twluPLBX9Ta0jwjlF3if0",
      "index": "b2t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1842349888,
      "version": 4810,
      "versionNonce": 104629440,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763109930684,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A node is a distributed peer within an overall\nsystem of nodes that wish to collaborate on\nreaching consensus on their distributed state. \n\n2. a node will keep track of its node_state,\nwhich keeps state about 3 different\n(independent) roles that a node plays: \n   - learner role\n   - acceptor role\n   - proposer role\n\n  All 3 states have their own state transitions,\nbest thought of via an FSM\n\n3. a node will keep it's own",
      "fontSize": 16.855686215915338,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. A node is a distributed peer within an overall system of nodes that wish to collaborate on reaching consensus on their distributed state. \n\n2. a node will keep track of its node_state, which keeps state about 3 different (independent) roles that a node plays: \n   - learner role\n   - acceptor role\n   - proposer role\n\n  All 3 states have their own state transitions, best thought of via an FSM\n\n3. a node will keep it's own",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
