      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763130219810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[DECISION] \n\n1. Update the storage interface to have node state. We will\ndo constraint sharing for this at the functor, so we can\nname the internal module type something more relevant to\nstorage (e.g. snapshot_payload, consensus_payload)\n\n2. we shall change Storage_mem to Make_mem_storage. The\nfile based version shall just be Make_file_storage. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "FI--lSXqYhSjafaID_41P",
      "originalText": "[DECISION] \n\n1. Update the storage interface to have node state. We will do constraint sharing for this at the functor, so we can name the internal module type something more relevant to storage (e.g. snapshot_payload, consensus_payload)\n\n2. we shall change Storage_mem to Make_mem_storage. The file based version shall just be Make_file_storage. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
