      "updated": 1763116587196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[DECISION] \n\n1. hydration helpers are\nwithin the simulator.ml.\nThey are not exposed\nby the runtime\ninterface",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ojTn1UvVxSB19qfW_xD1b",
      "originalText": "[DECISION] \n\n1. hydration helpers are within the simulator.ml. They are not exposed by the runtime interface",
